Subject: [Rpy] rpy2-2.8.6 is out and on pypi
Message-ID: <CA+JCgN1UPsTqxrdV1f8H1f0UvoOn1cAJQtD6KV4zp6vGKe3n8w@mail.gmail.com>

This is a maintenance bugfix release in the 2.8.x series.

Release 2.8.6=============Bugs fixed----------- Trying to build an
atomic R vector from a Python object that has a length,  but is not a
sequence nor an iterator was causing a segfault (issue #407 -
backport from rpy2-2.9.0).- Passing parameters names that are empty
strings to an R function was  causing a segfault (issue #409 -
backport from rpy2-2.9.0).

